      "id": "aigu",
      "mark": "é",
      "name": "e accent aigu",
      "pr": "uh ak-sahn tay-GÜ",
      "fa": "اُ آکسان تِگو",
      "hint": "Sounds like “ay”, a closed e. The most common accent in French.",
      "trick": "Aigu goes UP, like your voice going up in “ay!”. Rising accent, rising sound.",
      "words": [
        "école",
        "bébé",
        "épouse"
      ],
      "wordsEn": {
