      "pr": "uh ak-sahn GRAHV",
      "fa": "اُ آکسان گراو",
      "hint": "Sounds like “eh” in “bed”, an open e.",
      "trick": "Grave goes DOWN, like a grave in the ground. A low, open “eh”.",
      "words": [
        "mère",
        "père",
        "frère"
      ],
      "wordsEn": {
        "mère": "mother",
        "père": "father",
        "frère": "brother"
