      "name": "a accent circonflexe",
      "pr": "ah ak-sahn seer-kohn-FLEKS",
      "fa": "آ آکسان سیرکُنفلِکس",
      "hint": "A slightly deeper “ah”. Often another lost s.",
      "trick": "Château was once “chastel”, like castle. The hat replaced the s.",
